      "en": "Moreover it has not seen the sun nor known it. This has rest rather than the other.",
      "ko": "햇빛을 보지 못하고 알지 못하나 이가 저보다 평안함이라",
      "source_text_hash": "2dc6bfeb5b10db44f8df9dbb0b172f062a5976aecfb02d3ca3238c2f83dee1b7",
      "translation_text_hash": "d774931e9abe91a33630ce9746962b1077c7c912a2003a5ae264e061c8b36c52",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "햇빛을 보지 못하고 알지 못하나 이가 저보다 평안함이라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "d774931e9abe91a33630ce9746962b1077c7c912a2003a5ae264e061c8b36c52"
      ]
